          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Creates a better experience for you and your patients</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Easier, faster, and less painful to apply and remove<sup>8</sup></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Reduced scarring<sup>10</sup></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Increased range of motion during recovery<sup>8</sup></span></span><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
