          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Saves you cost and time</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Fewer wound complications<sup>1</sup></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Reduced post-discharge cost<sup>3</sup></span></span><br>\n</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">No added entry sites for bacteria<sup>6</sup><br>\n </span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
